{"id":"vod_md_3354","vodId":"3354","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"樱子小姐的脚下埋着尸体","name_cn":"樱子小姐的脚下埋着尸体","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230826-1/20caa78cf5e9a73d940764663e22a003.jpg"},"summary":"在寒冷的北海道旭川市某处，生活着以美人自居的大小姐九条樱子（伊藤静 配音）。除了有些自恋外，樱子还有用死尸骨头制作标本的怪癖，其对于验尸更有着较深的学识。也许正是对尸体、骨骼那有着近乎偏执的异乎寻常的喜爱，让樱子接二连三卷入各种匪夷所思的死亡事件中。在此过程中，普通高中生馆胁正太郎（榎木淳弥 配音）也被樱子牵着鼻子跑来跑去，见证着每一个案件被侦破的瞬间。对于死者来说，恰恰因为有了樱子这样的怪人，才让他们的冤屈得以昭雪……本片根据太田紫织的同名轻小说改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-26 08:54:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/JDBhNQbs/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/By64mtFn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/zoj5bKdh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/nzWRYsxK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/upL0pba0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/8a0nGumV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/kw8cagMq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/lFkbaAiz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/X9nYTIsL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/B8BXYpwd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/aqzOD8yl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/u6qIdKSZ/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:28.153Z"}